{
  "uid": "jithendar-com-observability",
  "title": "Jithendar.com · Observability",
  "description": "Metrics (Prometheus), logs (Loki) and traces (Jaeger) for jithendar.com on one page. Source: jithendar.com repository, grafana/.",
